Article 3 (Applicability to exclusion from application of this Act)
(1) The amended provisions of Article 39(1) shall also apply where a war veteran was excluded from the application of this Act before this Act enters into force because the war veteran fell under any of the subparagraphs of paragraph (1) of that Article.
(2) The amended provisions of Article 39(2) shall also apply where the spouse of a war veteran fell under any of the subparagraphs of paragraph (1) of that Article before this Act enters into force.

