ADDENDA <Act No. 21366, Feb. 19, 2026>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force 3 months after the date of its promulgation; provided, the amended provisions of Article 7(1) and (2) shall enter into force 6 months after the date of promulgation of this Act.
Article 2 (Applicability to medical treatment at medical institutions of public organizations)
The amended provisions of Article 7(1) and (2) shall begin to apply where medical treatment is received at a medical institution established and operated by a public organization after those amended provisions enter into force.
